@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@authToken = Bearer eyJhbGciOi...

### Crear Concurso en Catálogo (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/contests
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hackatón UNAM 2025",
  "categoryId": "CAT_UUID_HERE"
}

### Listar Concursos en Catálogo
GET {{baseUrl}}/contests
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### Inscribir Alumno a un Concurso (Alumno autenticado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/contests/enroll
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contestId": "CONTEST_UUID_HERE"
}

### Eliminar Inscripción a Concurso (Alumno propietario)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/contests/enrollment/REGISTRATION_UUID_HERE
Authorization: {{authToken}}
